00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:15.018
- So I've been getting a lot
of emails, a lot of tweets,

00:00:15.018 --> 00:00:17.102
a lot of YouTube comments, a
lot of messages from people

00:00:17.102 --> 00:00:19.601
who have questions for their
business from your guys

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:21.539
who want help in growing your company.

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:23.156
You have some specific questions for me,

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:26.163
and it's been impossible for
me to get back to everybody,

00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:29.675
and so what I wanted to
do was use this channel,

00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:32.825
use this series, as an
opportunity to answer questions

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:35.538
from you guys and either
make a 7 ways video

00:00:35.538 --> 00:00:37.805
to help answer your question
or maybe something else

00:00:37.805 --> 00:00:40.638
but I want to use this
video right here, this video

00:00:40.638 --> 00:00:43.056
and the comments below for you guys

00:00:43.056 --> 00:00:44.911
to write down the questions and the topics

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:48.431
that you want me to cover and
so what we'll do is every week

00:00:48.431 --> 00:00:50.123
as I go through this, look at which

00:00:50.123 --> 00:00:51.865
are the most popular questions,

00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:53.723
which one will help the most of you

00:00:53.723 --> 00:00:55.307
and that's what we'll make a video on.

00:00:55.307 --> 00:00:56.912
So if you have a question for me

00:00:56.912 --> 00:00:58.135
that you'd like me to cover,

00:00:58.135 --> 00:00:59.792
leave it down on the comments below.

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.565
If you want to vote on the ones

00:01:01.565 --> 00:01:04.674
that you want to see me
answer and make a video on,

00:01:04.674 --> 00:01:07.437
then give it a thumbs up to
the people who commented below

00:01:07.437 --> 00:01:10.129
and every week I'm going to go
through and look at the top ones

00:01:10.129 --> 00:01:13.239
and those are the ones we
are going to make videos on.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.157
So it's a test, it's an experiment.

00:01:15.157 --> 00:01:16.713
I'd love to know what you guys think,

00:01:16.713 --> 00:01:18.510
looking forward to seeing
your comments down below.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:22.677
Much love, continue to
believe, and I'll see you soon.

